WEBVTT

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:09.610
Shino!

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:18.200
For me?

00:01:53.590 --> 00:01:55.050
This is quite the work of art.

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:59.720
You girls! The level 5 exam is no laughing matter! Have you been preparing!?

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.350
Just leave it to us!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:06.680
That's not reassuring at all.

00:02:08.270 --> 00:02:09.730
Hey, Pop-chan.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:10.670
What?

00:02:10.670 --> 00:02:13.350
Yer gonna take the level 9 exam, right?

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.040
The test is at midnight, so can ya wake up that late?

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:16.490
Yup!

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:19.660
Pop won't be able to wake up!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.410
You're just a kid!

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.950
I'm different than you Doremi, so I'm sure I'll be able to.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:26.000
Yep!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:29.210
Pop is definitely in a league all her own. She's brave and strong.

00:02:30.580 --> 00:02:31.760
Yay!

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:33.590
Thank you, Plush-chan.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:34.380
Majo Rika!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:39.720
I'm the type of person that works harder when there are people complimenting me.

00:02:40.590 --> 00:02:43.100
You're so reliable, unlike Doremi.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.640
What?

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:54.380
Presents From Mongolia.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:04.120
One more year...

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:07.580
Yeah, it seemed like we didn't enjoy summer to its fullest.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.250
It's because we were always at the Maho-dou.

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:13.580
Give me back my summer vacation.

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:17.050
I think the other classmates had a lot of fun.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:24.180
I went to Paris, France!

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:28.560
My father got me this brand name bag when we were there.

00:03:29.850 --> 00:03:31.980
That looks like an expensive bag.

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.730
Of course!

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.400
You have to reserve it half a year in advance to get it.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:38.570
Then how'd ya get it, Tamaki?

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:42.240
My father ordered it for me by calling them internationally.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.580
An international call? Your father must know how to speak French then!

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:46.700
Of course he does.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.330
That's a wonderful picture.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.150
Thank you.

00:03:57.150 --> 00:04:00.300
My friend Tamila-kun from Mongolia sent it to me.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:02.280
Mongolia?

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:03.010
What, what?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:04.110
What'cha talkin' about?

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:06.010
Shino-chan, you were in Mongolia?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:09.460
Yes. I went over there for summer vacation.

00:04:10.130 --> 00:04:12.100
But... where is Mongolia?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:16.560
On a map, it's to the north of China.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:19.270
I know about it.

00:04:19.270 --> 00:04:21.950
People there are part of nomadic, horse-riding tribes.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:25.200
They live in round tents.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.990
Yeah yeah, you're talking about Gers.

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.060
They're called Gers?

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:35.630
Yeah, I rode horses over the grassy plains and lived in a Ger.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:39.960
I also got a postcard from a friend over there.

00:04:41.010 --> 00:04:42.590
Wow, I've never seen this language before!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:44.510
What, what?

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:47.470
Shino-chan got a postcard from Mongolia after staying there.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:48.850
Mongolia?

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:52.270
Hanada, you've stayed in another country?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:53.480
Yeah, I have.

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:55.520
What does this say?

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.420
It says,

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:58.980
"Hello, how is Japan?"

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.440
"I won a horseback riding race today."

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.490
Wow, you really can read it, Hanada.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.940
How do you say "hello" in Mongolian?

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.950
"Sain baina uu."

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.870
I can also read foreign words!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.080
A-And I could get letters sent to me!

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:19.420
No, I do get letters sent to me!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.300
How wonderful.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.240
I want to go to another country too.

00:05:24.600 --> 00:05:25.760
Yeah.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:29.530
I could make many friends and get many postcards sent to me.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:31.220
Ya ain't gonna make any friends if all you want is postcards.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.040
You'll hafta send 'em postcards, too.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.140
Oh yeah.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.600
What's wrong?

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:38.900
Shino-chan?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:41.070
Actually...

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.130
I have something to tell you.

00:05:44.130 --> 00:05:45.150
What is it?

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:48.280
Can you guys come over?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.780
How nice.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:52.570
You are going to Hanada-san's house?

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:56.660
Of course, it would not be a problem at all if you invited me, too.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:59.170
Sure. That's fine.

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.670
No one invited you.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.630
Goodness, Hanada-san, where is your house?

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.260
We're almost there. Look, over there.

00:06:09.260 --> 00:06:10.340
Where, where?

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:12.010
She's so nosy...

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:14.100
On the fifth floor of that apartment.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.350
An apartment, eh?

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.640
I thought you lived in a single story house.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.190
That's quite enough.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:28.910
I've never seen stuff like this before.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:31.820
These are all souvenirs from the places I've been to.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:34.040
You've sure been all over, haven't ya?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.160
How wonderful.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.830
I have a lot of souvenirs too.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.500
Plates from Italy and perfume from France...

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:41.250
And from America...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.290
The same place as the postcard!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:45.990
Hey, this is Mongolia, right?

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:46.460
Yep!

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:50.430
That's Tamila-kun, right? How cute!

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:54.390
Oh my, this doll looks so worn out.

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.310
Yeah.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:01.480
Actually, this doll can be found all over Japan.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.270
I used to have one too.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.570
But after a while, I got tired of it and threw it away.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:09.240
Then what is that?

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:12.370
This was from my friend Tamila-kun in Mongolia.

00:07:12.370 --> 00:07:14.040
Wow, what a weird person.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:15.410
I wish she would shut up.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:18.210
Is this what you wanted to talk to us about?

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.570
Yeah.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:23.000
I just don't know what to give him in return.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.000
He'll like anything you give him.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:26.800
Yeah.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:28.300
But...

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:32.510
This was Tamila-kun's only toy.

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:36.180
I'm his precious friend, but he shouldn't have given me his only toy.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:38.600
Huh? He doesn't have any other toys?

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.890
He makes his own toys.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:43.270
He spends his other time riding horses and wrestling.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.110
What do you think I should give him?

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:51.070
Yeah. How about you make a doll for him?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:53.200
Oh yeah, a handmade toy.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.160
I think you should give him a toy of higher class.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:56.990
Higher class?

00:07:56.990 --> 00:07:58.930
How about this?

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:01.830
It's a brand name lipstick for kids.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:03.290
I don't use this anymore.

00:08:03.290 --> 00:08:04.790
He's a boy.

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:05.630
Oh yeah.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.570
Were you listening to her story at all?

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:11.970
Ya don't hafta give him anything in return, ya just have to show him yer thanks.

00:08:11.970 --> 00:08:12.550
That's it!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.130
Why don't we give him beef?

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.680
Are you talking about giving him steak?

00:08:17.680 --> 00:08:18.720
Of course!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.550
Y-Yeah.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:23.030
Thank you, guys.

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:25.190
I'll think about it a bit more.

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.550
Please think about my idea too.

00:08:28.550 --> 00:08:29.690
We get it, we get it.

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.320
What should we do?

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:32.700
How about magic?

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:33.680
Looks like it.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.200
Let me think. What was his name again?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.120
Tamila-kun!

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:41.870
Yeah that's it, let's ask him what he wants.

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.710
Alright!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:44.510
Okay, let's do it.

00:08:44.510 --> 00:08:44.920
Yeah!

00:08:58.510 --> 00:09:00.890
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.230
Pretty Witchy Hadzuki-chi!

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.150
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:10.980
Pirika Pirilala Carefreely!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.820
Paipai Ponpoi Flexibly!

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:23.160
Pameruku Laruku Proudly!

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.590
Magical Stage!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.260
Please tell us what Tamila-kun wants!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.070
Huh?

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.490
Did we fail?

00:09:55.490 --> 00:09:56.950
Nothing happened.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.410
What's going on?

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:00.570
I used up all my magic spheres.

00:10:01.070 --> 00:10:02.220
Why?

00:10:02.220 --> 00:10:03.910
Was the magic too tough?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:05.600
What's wrong?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:06.940
What should we do?

00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:08.670
About the level 5 exam...

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:10.920
Oh yeah!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:13.920
We can't take the exam without magic spheres!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:17.190
This is bad. Majo Rika's gonna get us.

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:17.680
Yeah.

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.140
You're working pretty hard.

00:10:31.060 --> 00:10:33.360
Really! You've made so much!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.570
We can do it when we get serious.

00:10:35.570 --> 00:10:38.950
That puts me at ease. I'll leave the rest of this to you.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.450
I'm going out for a bit.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:41.530
Later.

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:45.620
Let's make some more.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:47.790
Yep! We can get more magic spheres after we sell 'em.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.080
Let's do it.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:56.670
This is the perfect time to have no customers.

00:10:57.510 --> 00:11:00.130
We've been able to pass without magic before.

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.010
It'll all work out.

00:11:02.680 --> 00:11:04.380
I sure hope so.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:06.140
What are you girls doing?

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:09.100
Y-You're back, Majo Rika.

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:13.900
What? Is something wrong? Are you hiding something from me?

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:15.860
Nothing at all!

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:18.820
Nope.

00:11:22.570 --> 00:11:24.990
Yup! There's no way you'll figure it out!

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:25.910
A-Ai-chan!

00:11:25.910 --> 00:11:27.450
It's fine, it's fine.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.290
We've gotten such good care from the ladies here at the Maho-dou.

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.540
We were thinkin' of giving ya somethin' as thanks!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:35.170
How nice!

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:37.800
Lala, what is it that you'd want?

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.590
I see. She's looking for suggestions.

00:11:40.590 --> 00:11:41.840
What's wrong, Hadzuki?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:42.640
Nothing.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:47.260
Well... I'd like a coupon to the Witch World Beauty Salon.

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.890
Beauty salon...

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:52.290
I don't think that will work...

00:11:52.290 --> 00:11:53.740
What won't work?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.200
Nothing, I'm talking to myself.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.650
Oh yeah, let's ask Oyaji!

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.150
I'm trying to sleep.

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:03.220
Oyajiide, what is the thing you want the most?

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.120
The thing I want most?

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:07.580
A young and pretty girl with a nice body.

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:09.580
That was a bad idea.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.750
How about Majo Rika?

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:13.670
Me?

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:14.250
Yeah.

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.790
You want to hear it?

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:16.420
Yep!

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:22.340
What I want the most is...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:23.840
Turning back to normal!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.440
No one bought anything...

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:55.750
What's wrong, Doremi?

00:12:56.290 --> 00:12:59.590
Well... It's nothing.

00:13:00.380 --> 00:13:04.010
Your exam is today, so be sure to wake up on time.

00:13:04.010 --> 00:13:05.590
I won't wake you up!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.980
I don't have any magic spheres and I can't use magic right now.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.230
I can't tell Pop that.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.390
I should just go to sleep.

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:21.650
But I can't just throw everything aside.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:23.440
I should at least check it out first.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.210
What should I do?

00:13:25.210 --> 00:13:28.030
Without magic spheres, I can't take the exam.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.290
Oh well, I should get goin' to the Maho-dou.

00:13:37.290 --> 00:13:40.000
Pop, hey Pop!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:44.170
If you don't wake up, you'll miss the exam!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:50.760
I will beat Doremi.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.220
Hey now.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:54.430
What!?

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:59.690
She couldn't get up!?

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.770
I tried over and over.

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:07.030
She can't wake up... That Pop... My hopes and dreams...

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.700
I think it's too much to have her stay up.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.330
Well, that's how it is.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.030
That's why she's just a little kid.

00:14:14.030 --> 00:14:17.660
Stop stating the obvious and work harder for Pop's sake!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:22.660
Welcome...!

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.840
Nice seeing you all again...!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:29.180
Okay, let's start.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:34.890
Use magic clay to make the things we want right now...

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.180
Magic clay?

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.600
So we don't have to use magic spheres?

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.350
That's right...

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.610
We're so lucky.

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.070
What do you mean by lucky?

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.320
It's nothin'!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.780
What Mota and Motamota want?

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:53.490
What is it?

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.790
That's what you have to figure out...

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:57.750
Oh yeah!

00:14:57.750 --> 00:15:01.560
We hafta guess what other people want here too?

00:15:01.560 --> 00:15:04.040
What they want...

00:15:04.040 --> 00:15:06.840
Hey, you should be able to find out by using Magical Stage.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.330
What are you saying!?

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:12.860
Learning other people's thoughts is high level magic.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:17.270
Even if these Ojamajos use up all of their spheres, they won't get an answer.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.140
I knew it.

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:23.770
Now then, please answer before that hourglass empties...

00:15:23.770 --> 00:15:26.440
Huh? There's a time limit?

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:37.740
I got it!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:40.810
What're those?

00:15:40.810 --> 00:15:41.980
Magic spheres.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.920
Ain't that what <i>you  </i>want?

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.130
Was it that obvious?

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.640
Yeah, completely.

00:15:46.640 --> 00:15:48.810
But I could still be right.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:50.340
You're wrong...

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.010
Why does she want magic spheres?

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.430
She's thinkin' too much.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.770
I made a brooch.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:01.770
It's pretty cute...

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.440
Oh? So was I right?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.190
Nope...

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.230
Give us a hint already.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.400
Well...

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.110
It's this feeling...

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:12.530
What's that?

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.120
How wonderful...

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:20.700
But you're wrong...

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:27.540
Maybe the things around them have something to do with it.

00:16:32.760 --> 00:16:34.130
This umbrella holder!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.430
Well? Is this it?

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.360
No, this is a custom made...

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:41.140
Vase...

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:42.810
A vase?

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:44.060
I couldn't tell at all.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.860
It doesn't look like a vase without any flowers in it.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.690
I got it! Is this it?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.400
Ahh! That's it...!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:56.530
I did it! A vase has to have flowers!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.580
This is it... I can finally scratch back here...

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:02.040
I wanted this back scratcher...

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.980
My back was so itchy...

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:09.590
Yeah, I can finally reach back there...

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.920
What are you talking about!? It's a flower! A flower!

00:17:11.920 --> 00:17:13.170
Huh? It was a flower..?

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:14.220
Yeah!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:15.880
No, it's a back scratcher.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:16.510
Yep.

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:18.940
Okay, we shall now give you...

00:17:18.940 --> 00:17:23.560
The level 5 exam... spheres of certification...

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.110
Jeez.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:32.900
I worked so hard to make a flower.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:35.530
Then they said they wanted a back scratcher?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.740
Oh well, we passed.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:41.120
But that was weird, wanting back scratchers.

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:42.120
No joke.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:47.040
If I was them, I would have asked for something more expensive.

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:50.710
Oh yeah, both of them were scratching their backs.

00:17:50.710 --> 00:17:52.250
Huh? Really?

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.090
Oh yeah, I guess they were.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:58.430
Hey I got it! When askin' others what they want, we should get to know the person better first.

00:17:59.140 --> 00:18:01.890
Doremi, you aren't attentive enough.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.470
What? You didn't know either, Majo Rika!

00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:08.020
So if we can understand Shino-chan's friend better,

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:10.110
we can find out what he wants.

00:18:10.110 --> 00:18:11.020
Who?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:12.480
It's nothing!

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.780
Doremi!

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.200
Why didn't you wake me up?

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.910
What are you talking about? You're the one who wouldn't wake up.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:24.080
You're lying!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.960
You didn't want me to beat you, so you didn't wake me up on purpose!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:30.170
Stop blaming me.

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.130
I'll tell Plush-chan!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:36.170
Shino-chan!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.130
Doremi-chan.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:42.430
Have you decided what you're giving to Tamila-kun?

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:43.850
Nope, not at all.

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:45.720
We thought of somethin' important.

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.680
What is it?

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:49.270
Can we take a look at your room again?

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:50.600
Of course.

00:18:55.400 --> 00:18:57.820
Um... What's so important?

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.320
If we can understand Tamila-kun better...

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.910
We will know what to give him.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:07.790
Could ya tell us more about Tamila-kun?

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:08.950
Yep, yep.

00:19:08.950 --> 00:19:11.750
I want to know more about Mongolia.

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.040
Sure, okay.

00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:18.470
That looks cool. Did he let you ride this horse too?

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.450
Yep.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:21.640
This was the first horse that I rode on.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:28.890
I was scared at first, but once I got used to it, the wind felt so nice.

00:19:30.020 --> 00:19:32.900
We saw the grassy plains.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:38.400
I wanted to live in Mongolia forever when I saw that view.

00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:42.950
But I had to leave.

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:49.160
That's when I felt so embarrassed.

00:19:49.960 --> 00:19:54.420
Why didn't I treasure this toy like he did?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:20:02.180
And he gave me his only toy, to a friend that he may not see again.

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:05.640
Would I have been able to do the same thing?

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.020
Mongolia is such a nice place.

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:09.720
Yeah.

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.890
Shino-chan has such wonderful memories.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:20.900
That's why I must give him something that's precious to me in return.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:22.380
That's a good idea.

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:23.990
Yeah, it is!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.030
But...

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:30.540
Tamila-kun taught me so many things and gave me his precious toy, but...

00:20:31.780 --> 00:20:37.340
my most precious thing in comparison is not worthy at all.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.920
That's not true.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:41.260
That's not true at all.

00:20:42.620 --> 00:20:43.430
What, what?

00:20:43.430 --> 00:20:45.130
Look over here.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:48.050
Huh? The color of the grass suddenly changes.

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:51.600
Oh yeah, that always troubled me too.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:54.980
What is it, Shino-chan?

00:20:54.980 --> 00:20:56.440
I got it, I got it!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.560
What? What did ya get?

00:20:58.560 --> 00:21:05.510
Tamila-kun's green colored pencil was too short, so he couldn't draw with it anymore.

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:06.620
Green?

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:07.410
Yep!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:10.410
So that's why he changed to another color.

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.410
I think I've decided.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:17.080
I think I'll give him my precious 12 colored pencils.

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:20.090
I liked the box's design, that's why.

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:21.590
Look.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.090
So cute!

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:25.470
Is this your most precious thing?

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:26.300
Yep!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:31.720
That works! Although Tamila-kun doesn't really need this, it's something that's precious to Shino-chan!

00:21:31.720 --> 00:21:32.020
Yep.

00:21:32.020 --> 00:21:33.480
This'll definitely work!

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:37.480
Yes, I think he'll like it.

00:21:37.480 --> 00:21:38.980
Thank you, everyone.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.170
Thank you!

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:43.280
Now Tamila-kun can draw the green plains again!

00:21:44.990 --> 00:21:48.590
I want to ride on the grassy plains too.

00:21:48.590 --> 00:21:50.550
It sounds so lovely...

00:21:50.550 --> 00:21:52.240
I wanna visit 'em too!

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:56.760
It'd be fun if we all could go.

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:57.670
Yeah!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:05.500
Has everyone decided on who should be the class representative?

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:09.240
Will everyone be fooled by Tamaki-san's fancy speech?

00:22:09.240 --> 00:22:12.120
The class representative should be someone that actually cares about us!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:14.410
So our suggestion is...

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:16.280
Miyamoto Masaharu-kun!

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:19.400
Masaharu-kun is righteous, kind, and honest!

00:22:19.400 --> 00:22:20.900
But in schoolwork and sports...

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:21.850
He's always second!

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:23.100
Ah, ya didn't hafta say that.

00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:24.200
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:26.550
Defeat Tamaki! The Class Representative Election.

00:22:26.550 --> 00:22:29.260
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
